<title>GERMANY: BMW says plans to raise return on sales.</title>
<headline>BMW says plans to raise return on sales.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Bayerische Motoren-Werke AG (BMW) said on Tuesday it wanted to raise its return on sales to seven percent from 3.2 percent in the long term.</p>
<p>Board member Volker Doppelfeld told reporters the company had already almost achieved its goal in the car division and other units would be brought in line.</p>
<p>Return on sales ought to be improved significantly this year, he said.</p>
</text>
